TSECE–Suprakernel API Specification

Author: C. Matthew BlackwellScope: Internal engine‑level API between TSECE subsystems and Suprakernel.

1. Module overview

Ingest API: tsece.ingest.*

Solver API (D‑Matter): tsece.solver.*

Encryption Spine API: tsece.encryption.*

Visualization API: tsece.visualization.*

Feedback Loop API: tsece.feedback.*

Integration Hooks (Suprakernel): suprakernel.bridge.*

2. Ingest API (tsece.ingest)

2.1 get_substrate_state()

Description: Returns current thermodynamic substrate state vector.

Signature:

X_sub = get_substrate_state()

Return:

X_sub = { P(t), ε_oxy, ε_field, T_drift, H_sub }

2.2 stream_substrate_state(callback)

Description: Streams substrate state updates to a callback.

Signature:

stream_substrate_state(fn: (X_sub) -> None)

3. Solver API (tsece.solver)

3.1 step_dmatter(q, p, dt)

Description: Performs one D‑Matter kernel integration step.

Signature:

(q_next, p_next) = step_dmatter(q, p, dt)

Inputs:

q: positions (simplicial manifold)

p: momenta

dt: timestep

Outputs:

q_next, p_next

3.2 apply_constraints(q)

Description: Applies simplicial constraints.

Signature:

q_constrained = apply_constraints(q)

4. Encryption Spine API (tsece.encryption)

4.1 hash_state(X_t, A_t)

Description: Computes state hash.

Signature:

h_t = hash_state(X_t, A_t)

4.2 write_ledger_entry(X_t, h_t, K_CMW, dH_t)

Description: Writes encrypted ledger entry.

Signature:

L_t = write_ledger_entry(X_t, h_t, K_CMW, dH_t)

4.3 verify_transition(X_t, h_t, proof)

Description: Verifies state transition via ZKP/PXI.

Signature:

ok = verify_transition(X_t, h_t, proof)

Return:

ok: boolean

5. Visualization API (tsece.visualization)

5.1 build_emergent_geometry(q)

Description: Builds emergent geometry from manifold state.

Signature:

geom = build_emergent_geometry(q)

5.2 attach_provenance(geom, L_t)

Description: Attaches provenance spine to geometry.

Signature:

geom_with_spine = attach_provenance(geom, L_t)

6. Feedback Loop API (tsece.feedback)

6.1 evaluate_drift(dH_t)

Description: Evaluates Hamiltonian drift against threshold.

Signature:

status = evaluate_drift(dH_t)

Return:

status ∈ { "stable", "warning", "critical" }

6.2 engage_circuit_breaker(reason)

Description: Engages circuit breaker mode.

Signature:

engage_circuit_breaker(reason: str)

7. Suprakernel Integration Hooks (suprakernel.bridge)

7.1 push_detection_input(X_sub)

Description: Pushes substrate state into Suprakernel detection layer.

Signature:

push_detection_input(X_sub)

7.2 report_verified_transition(X_t, L_t)

Description: Reports a verified transition to Suprakernel.

Signature:

report_verified_transition(X_t, L_t)

7.3 notify_circuit_breaker(status, reason)

Description: Notifies Suprakernel of feedback loop circuit breaker events.

Signature:

notify_circuit_breaker(status, reason)

